# Task: what is on the shopping list?

A task card, as it is posted. It names the profile it runs under and the channel it came
from. It is never edited after it is posted: what happens to it is the fold of its records
in the ledger (`run/ledger.jsonl`, written when you run the sample).

```json
{
  "stew": "2026-11-08-draft",
  "kind": "task",
  "id": "t-0001",
  "board": "samples",
  "profile": "note-reader@1",
  "ask": "What is on the shopping list?",
  "source": "console",
  "posted_at": "2026-11-08T09:00:00Z"
}
```
